<%# Item 4 (v27): embedded Ruby calls in a view template are captured as a %>
<%# reference-only KindFileRef fact, so helpers/class methods invoked ONLY from %>
<%# a view are not mis-reported as dead. This comment tag is ignored. %>
<div class="report">
  <%# ReportPresenter.render_summary is a class-method call -> recorded. %>
  <%= ReportPresenter.render_summary(@report) %>

  <% if current_user.can_view_reports? %>
    <p>Visible</p>
  <% end %>

  <%# IgnoredHelper.never_recorded lives in a comment tag and must be skipped. %>
</div>
